{"page":63,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:101","surah":3,"ayah":101,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَيْفَ تَكْفُرُونَ وَأَنتُمْ تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْكُمْ ءَايَـٰتُ ٱللَّهِ وَفِيكُمْ رَسُولُهُۥ ۗ وَمَن يَعْتَصِم بِٱللَّهِ فَقَدْ هُدِىَ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How can you disbelieve when God’s revelations are being recited to you and His Messenger is living among you? Whoever holds fast to God will be guided to the straight path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَيْفَ","en_gloss":"And how (could)","transliteration":"wakayfa","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"you disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurūna","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"while [you]","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُتْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"is recited","transliteration":"tut'lā","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(the) Verses","transliteration":"āyātu","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَفِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"and among you","transliteration":"wafīkum","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَسُولُهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"(is) His Messenger","transliteration":"rasūluhu","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَعْتَصِم","en_gloss":"holds firmly","transliteration":"yaʿtaṣim","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then surely","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُدِىَ","en_gloss":"he is guided","transliteration":"hudiya","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":16,"ar":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","en_gloss":"a path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmin","verse_key":"3:101"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٠١","en_gloss":"(101)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:101"}]},{"verse_key":"3:102","surah":3,"ayah":102,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ حَقَّ تُقَاتِهِۦ وَلَا تَمُوتُنَّ إِلَّا وَأَنتُم مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, be mindful of God, as is His due, and make sure you devote yourselves to Him, to your dying moment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حَقَّ","en_gloss":"(as is His) right","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُقَاتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(that) He (should) be feared","transliteration":"tuqātihi","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَمُوتُنَّ","en_gloss":"die","transliteration":"tamūtunna","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَنتُم","en_gloss":"[while you]","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(as) Muslims","transliteration":"mus'limūna","verse_key":"3:102"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٠٢","en_gloss":"(102)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:102"}]},{"verse_key":"3:103","surah":3,"ayah":103,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱعْتَصِمُوا۟ بِحَبْلِ ٱللَّهِ جَمِيعًا وَلَا تَفَرَّقُوا۟ ۚ وَٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَتَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ إِذْ كُنتُمْ أَعْدَآءً فَأَلَّفَ بَيْنَ قُلُوبِكُمْ فَأَصْبَحْتُم بِنِعْمَتِهِۦٓ إِخْوَٰنًا وَكُنتُمْ عَلَىٰ شَفَا حُفْرَةٍ مِّنَ ٱلنَّارِ فَأَنقَذَكُم مِّنْهَا ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ يُبَيِّنُ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Hold fast to God’s rope all together; do not split into factions. Remember God’s favour to you: you were enemies and then He brought your hearts together and you became brothers by His grace; you were about to fall into a pit of Fire and He saved you from it- in this way God makes His revelations clear to you so that you may be rightly guided.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱعْتَصِمُوا۟","en_gloss":"And hold firmly","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'taṣimū","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِحَبْلِ","en_gloss":"to (the) rope","transliteration":"biḥabli","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"all together","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَفَرَّقُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"be divided","transliteration":"tafarraqū","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"And remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نِعْمَتَ","en_gloss":"(the) Favor","transliteration":"niʿ'mata","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَعْدَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"enemies","transliteration":"aʿdāan","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَأَلَّفَ","en_gloss":"then He made friendship","transliteration":"fa-allafa","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قُلُوبِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your hearts","transliteration":"qulūbikum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَأَصْبَحْتُم","en_gloss":"then you became","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥtum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بِنِعْمَتِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"by His Favor","transliteration":"biniʿ'matihi","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِخْوَٰنًۭا","en_gloss":"brothers","transliteration":"ikh'wānan","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَكُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"And you were","transliteration":"wakuntum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":21,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":22,"ar":"شَفَا","en_gloss":"(the) brink","transliteration":"shafā","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":23,"ar":"حُفْرَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) pit","transliteration":"ḥuf'ratin","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":26,"ar":"فَأَنقَذَكُم","en_gloss":"then He saved you","transliteration":"fa-anqadhakum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":27,"ar":"مِّنْهَا ۗ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":28,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":29,"ar":"يُبَيِّنُ","en_gloss":"makes clear","transliteration":"yubayyinu","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":31,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":32,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Verses","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":33,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":34,"ar":"تَهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"(be) guided","transliteration":"tahtadūna","verse_key":"3:103"},{"pos":35,"ar":"١٠٣","en_gloss":"(103)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:103"}]},{"verse_key":"3:104","surah":3,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"وَلْتَكُن مِّنكُمْ أُمَّةٌ يَدْعُونَ إِلَى ٱلْخَيْرِ وَيَأْمُرُونَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَيَنْهَوْنَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ ۚ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Be a community that calls for what is good, urges what is right, and forbids what is wrong: those who do this are the successful ones.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلْتَكُن","en_gloss":"And let there be","transliteration":"waltakun","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُمَّةٌۭ","en_gloss":"[a] people","transliteration":"ummatun","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"inviting","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْخَيْرِ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-khayri","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَأْمُرُونَ","en_gloss":"[and] enjoining","transliteration":"wayamurūna","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","en_gloss":"the right","transliteration":"bil-maʿrūfi","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَنْهَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and forbidding","transliteration":"wayanhawna","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمُنكَرِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the wrong","transliteration":"l-munkari","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"and those ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the successful ones","transliteration":"l-muf'liḥūna","verse_key":"3:104"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٠٤","en_gloss":"(104)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:104"}]},{"verse_key":"3:105","surah":3,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَكُونُوا۟ كَٱلَّذِينَ تَفَرَّقُوا۟ وَٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ ۚ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not be like those who, after they have been given clear revelation, split into factions and fall into disputes: a terrible punishment awaits such people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"takūnū","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"like those who","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَفَرَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"became divided","transliteration":"tafarraqū","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","en_gloss":"and differed","transliteration":"wa-ikh'talafū","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them ","transliteration":"jāahumu","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ ۚ","en_gloss":"the clear proofs","transliteration":"l-bayinātu","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"And those","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"3:105"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٠٥","en_gloss":"(105)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:105"}]},{"verse_key":"3:106","surah":3,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ تَبْيَضُّ وُجُوهٌ وَتَسْوَدُّ وُجُوهٌ ۚ فَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ٱسْوَدَّتْ وُجُوهُهُمْ أَكَفَرْتُم بَعْدَ إِيمَـٰنِكُمْ فَذُوقُوا۟ ٱلْعَذَابَ بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when some faces brighten and others darken, it will be said to those with darkened faces, ‘How could you reject your faith after believing? Taste the torment for doing so,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(On the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَبْيَضُّ","en_gloss":"would become white","transliteration":"tabyaḍḍu","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وُجُوهٌۭ","en_gloss":"(some) faces","transliteration":"wujūhun","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَتَسْوَدُّ","en_gloss":"and would become black","transliteration":"wataswaddu","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وُجُوهٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"(some) faces","transliteration":"wujūhun","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَمَّا","en_gloss":"As for","transliteration":"fa-ammā","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whose","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱسْوَدَّتْ","en_gloss":"turn black","transliteration":"is'waddat","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وُجُوهُهُمْ","en_gloss":"[their] faces ","transliteration":"wujūhuhum","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَكَفَرْتُم","en_gloss":"Did you disbelieve","transliteration":"akafartum","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your belief","transliteration":"īmānikum","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَذُوقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Then taste","transliteration":"fadhūqū","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used to","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"3:106"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurū